==========================================================================================
reqparse location='json' / request.json semantics under Werkzeug 2.2
==========================================================================================
  OK   no body, no content-type                             -> {'foo': None}
  OK   json content-type, valid body                        -> {'foo': 'bar'}
  RAISE json content-type, MALFORMED body                   -> BadRequest(code=400) None
  RAISE json content-type, EMPTY body                       -> BadRequest(code=400) None
  OK   json content-type, body 'null'                       -> {'foo': None}
  OK   json content-type, body is a LIST                    -> {'foo': None}
  OK   json content-type, body is a STRING                  -> {'foo': None}
  RAISE json content-type, body is an INT                   -> TypeError(code=None) None
  OK   text/plain content-type with json body               -> {'foo': None}
  OK   application/json;charset=utf-8                       -> {'foo': 'bar'}
  OK   application/vnd.api+json (json suffix)               -> {'foo': 'bar'}

default location ('json','values') -- the DEFAULT for every Argument
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  OK   form body, default location                          -> {'foo': 'bar'}
  OK   query string, default location                       -> {'foo': 'bar'}
  RAISE form body + MALFORMED json ct                       -> BadRequest(code=400) None
  OK   no body at all, default location                     -> {'foo': None}
  RAISE required + no body                                  -> BadRequest(code=400) {'message': {'foo': 'Missing required parameter in the JSON body or the post body or the query string'}}
  RAISE required + no body, location json                   -> BadRequest(code=400) {'message': {'foo': 'Missing required parameter in the JSON body'}}

strict mode
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  OK   strict, no ct                                        -> {'foo': None}
  RAISE strict, json ct valid                               -> BadRequest(code=400) None
  RAISE strict, json ct malformed                           -> BadRequest(code=400) None

other locations
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  OK   headers                                              -> {'X-Foo': 'bar'}
  OK   cookies                                              -> {'c': '1'}
  OK   files                                                -> {'f': <FileStorage: 'a.txt' ('text/plain')>}
  OK   values on POST form                                  -> {'foo': 'bar'}
  OK   args on POST                                         -> {'foo': 'bar'}
